<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - March 27.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - March 27.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing</p>
<p>schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's</p>
<p>Mangalore port on March 27:</p>
<p>  Commodity	     Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Wheat		 1,043 (ULD) 28,957   M V Asian Banner   26/03</p>
<p> Granite Stone     1,041 (LDD)    573   M V Rashi	    22/03</p>
<p> Timber		  693 (ULD)    618   M V Irufa	    20/03</p>
<p>Iron</p>
